WEBVTT

00:06.090 --> 00:10.870
Right now, thanks to my last-minute appointment
to student council member,

00:10.870 --> 00:13.060
I'm getting to experience the jostle and
squeeze of the rush hour crowds.

00:18.770 --> 00:23.630
[ izu presents]

00:18.770 --> 00:23.630
Hey, Class President!

00:20.240 --> 00:23.630
Chapter 1 - The class president was... getting a different kind of rush hour squeeze.

00:23.810 --> 00:29.210
Translation : Henna | Typesetting : lucielnight
Timing: anon | Encoding: kuroyuki

00:29.240 --> 00:30.110
That's enough.

00:39.560 --> 00:43.610
Kokusai-san couldn't make it to team practice today, either.

00:46.220 --> 00:51.660
Yeah. The vice president left, so apparently
he's busy looking for a replacement.

00:52.780 --> 00:59.340
But it's so much easier to talk to the other upperclassmen
when Kokusai-san is around...

01:00.470 --> 01:01.400
Yeah, guess so.

01:02.920 --> 01:06.680
Oh, Chiga, you heard the rumor about him?

01:09.800 --> 01:11.050
What rumor?

01:11.870 --> 01:16.140
They say the former vice president harassed him, sexually...

01:19.230 --> 01:23.110
Wait, why's he getting pissed?
There's no reason to glare at me about it!

01:23.430 --> 01:25.150
What about me?

01:28.040 --> 01:29.200
Kokusai-san!

01:33.170 --> 01:36.830
What, they left all the cleaning to just the two of you?

01:36.960 --> 01:41.210
Yeah, they're bullying the weak! Please, give us a hand!

01:42.640 --> 01:44.810
Well, if there aren't any other freshmen around, I don't mind.

01:46.070 --> 01:47.720
That's quite all right, Kokusai-san.

01:48.300 --> 01:54.180
We wanted the dojo all to ourselves so we volunteered
for cleaning duty. You don't need to help.

01:55.600 --> 01:56.430
More importantly...

01:58.830 --> 02:01.560
Huh? Is Chiga... in a good mood again?

02:02.560 --> 02:06.130
You finally got a chance to come by, so how about a little match?

02:07.480 --> 02:09.960
My heart's started pounding...

02:11.070 --> 02:13.240
Why are you hesitating?

02:13.450 --> 02:18.830
Because, I mean, you look like you've gotten
stronger. I don't want to go up against you.

02:19.920 --> 02:23.340
Then why did you come to the dojo?

02:24.320 --> 02:27.920
I'm looking for a vice president right now,

02:28.470 --> 02:32.640
and I thought maybe Akutsu would do
it, just in name would be enough.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.450
So I came to ask him.

02:35.430 --> 02:40.480
Akutsu! I just need to fill in a name, that'd
be enough. Will you be vice president?

02:55.780 --> 02:59.120
Crap, even Akutsu refused to do it.

02:59.870 --> 03:02.830
Sure, because you asked him when he was meeting someone.

03:03.250 --> 03:05.750
You should've asked him the next time you saw him around.

03:11.960 --> 03:13.010
What is it?

03:14.090 --> 03:19.070
I was just thinking, if you would be vice
president, it'd make my life a lot easier...

03:19.530 --> 03:20.270
Huh?!

03:20.520 --> 03:24.520
Yeah, don't do it, Chiga! You'll never
make regular on the team if you do!

03:25.610 --> 03:27.480
You've got to be kidding me!

03:27.860 --> 03:31.700
You just said that because you don't
have anybody else left to ask, right?

03:32.780 --> 03:36.160
I won't do it unless there's a reason it has to be <i>me</i>!

03:36.520 --> 03:38.480
Wait, what are you saying?

03:38.910 --> 03:43.920
Actually, the very first person that came to mind was you, Chiga.

03:47.170 --> 03:52.060
But you take things seriously, unlike Akutsu,
So I thought it'd be a burden on you...

03:52.720 --> 03:55.050
I was... the first?

03:56.760 --> 04:01.060
You always say exactly what's on your
mind, so it's easy to work with you.

04:05.000 --> 04:08.610
Then... I don't mind doing it.

04:10.110 --> 04:11.240
You really don't mind?

04:11.300 --> 04:12.580
Seriously?

04:27.520 --> 04:30.150
What's wrong? Is he feeling sick?

04:32.220 --> 04:33.800
Oh, he noticed me.

04:35.830 --> 04:36.740
What is he...?

04:37.870 --> 04:40.070
What the hell is that coy, blushing look...?

04:43.910 --> 04:48.060
The class president was... getting a different
kind of rush hour squeeze.

04:51.780 --> 04:55.030
Come on, how old are you, anyway?

04:56.610 --> 04:59.910
If someone on the train tries to feel you
up, turn around and tell them no!

04:59.980 --> 05:06.250
We-Well, you're right, but it was a man
and I just, didn't have the confidence...

05:06.480 --> 05:08.210
Well, I do understand

05:08.300 --> 05:09.210
Right?!

05:09.430 --> 05:11.610
Eh? You're that passionate about the subject?

05:13.560 --> 05:16.880
How does everyone else bear it every morning?

05:17.220 --> 05:20.040
At least one thing always gets groped..

05:20.040 --> 05:21.090
"One thing"?!

05:23.740 --> 05:26.480
What part of Mr. Average Joe here is so irresistible?

05:26.830 --> 05:30.220
He's normal, completely normal!
Every last thing about him--normal!

05:30.330 --> 05:31.470
Or is it something in particular?

05:32.190 --> 05:32.900
His skin?

05:34.530 --> 05:35.320
His face?

05:35.740 --> 05:36.490
His body?

05:39.610 --> 05:40.370
His mannerisms...?

05:46.420 --> 05:48.080
I'm kinda thirsty.

05:49.130 --> 05:51.880
Chiga, you want some juice, too?

05:51.980 --> 05:52.800
Ye-Yes, please!

05:53.760 --> 05:56.550
I was just surprised--surprised, that's all!

06:04.170 --> 06:05.220
Excuse me...

06:08.130 --> 06:10.350
Hey, I'm gonna go show him where the exit is.

06:10.610 --> 06:14.610
A-Are you a moron?! Just follow the frickin' signs!

06:15.830 --> 06:17.500
I'm so, so sorry!

06:17.920 --> 06:21.300
He-Hey! You were incredibly rude just now!

06:21.520 --> 06:23.300
It doesn't hurt to be nice to...

06:23.300 --> 06:24.410
The doors are closing.

06:33.300 --> 06:37.710
He was asking you about where the exit is... right?

06:38.830 --> 06:39.380
Huh?

06:40.430 --> 06:42.470
U-Uh, yeah...

06:43.520 --> 06:46.390
Eh? Uh...

06:50.070 --> 06:51.850
Well, nevermind that.

06:52.270 --> 06:54.980
President, from now on I'll accompany you to and from school.

06:56.020 --> 06:57.040
You will?

06:58.830 --> 07:01.890
That makes me feel so, so, so much better!

06:59.560 --> 07:02.920
Why, why am I looking after an ordinary guy like him...

07:03.540 --> 07:09.910
So I made a promise with the president to go with him to
and from school starting this morning, like a bodyguard.

07:19.240 --> 07:22.180
And already some filthy molester's got his hands on him.

07:26.410 --> 07:30.480
Here, I'll stand around you like this, President.

07:33.220 --> 07:34.770
Wrong!

07:35.910 --> 07:36.940
Turn around!

07:37.050 --> 07:38.500
Ri-Right.

07:39.430 --> 07:42.740
Hey, your hair's all sticking up.

07:44.040 --> 07:46.740
Well, what about yours? It's all overgrown.

07:49.120 --> 07:51.160
Oh, his hair...

07:51.830 --> 07:56.380
It brushes against me whenever he moves. It feels nice...

08:00.800 --> 08:05.300
I'm going to the salon this weekend so it's fine.

08:06.350 --> 08:09.010
Whoa, why am I getting so c-c-close?!

08:09.550 --> 08:11.130
What're you doing?

08:11.520 --> 08:13.770
Wha-Wha-What am I...?

08:14.130 --> 08:16.400
And what the hell is up with my heartbeat?!

08:25.530 --> 08:27.160
My chest feels so tight...

08:27.690 --> 08:29.910
My heart won't stop pounding..

08:30.390 --> 08:31.700
I can't breathe!

08:36.780 --> 08:39.270
Ah, help me!

08:39.750 --> 08:44.340
I just wrapped my arms around--no, no, I clung to this guy...

08:44.650 --> 08:45.930
I guess it was anemia?

08:46.300 --> 08:47.930
Ye-Yeah, guess so...

08:48.430 --> 08:51.870
That's right! I'm anemic, I'm anemic, I'm anemic, I'm...

08:51.870 --> 08:54.230
But that's nice that you're going to a salon.

08:56.980 --> 08:57.690
Huh?

09:00.380 --> 09:02.690
Could I come with you?

09:03.280 --> 09:07.950
I'm sort of... embarrassed to take the first step by myself.

09:11.440 --> 09:12.700
I don't mind.

09:18.220 --> 09:19.170
Thanks a lot!

09:23.830 --> 09:25.260
That was totally my stomach making that sound just now!

09:25.430 --> 09:26.930
Okay, let's go.

09:32.350 --> 09:34.980
I ended up making plans with the president.

09:39.300 --> 09:42.220
Tomorrow, the president and I are going to get haircuts.

09:43.570 --> 09:45.940
We've never gone out together outside of school before.

09:47.090 --> 09:51.120
Let's see, where are the new clothes I just bought...

09:52.330 --> 09:53.580
Hey, wait a second!

09:54.260 --> 09:56.960
Why am I looking forward to this so much?!

10:01.150 --> 10:03.420
Hello, Kokusai-san?

10:05.230 --> 10:08.930
<i>Yes, about tomorrow... I'll come pick you up.</i>

10:09.220 --> 10:11.010
Oh, really? You don't mind?

10:11.390 --> 10:13.180
I'll be the one getting more sleep.

10:13.700 --> 10:16.350
<i>Hey, please make sure you're ready!</i>

10:16.890 --> 10:21.690
Just kidding! I'm really looking forward to this.

10:24.520 --> 10:28.450
<i>Oh, Akutsu just texted me. Hold on a sec.</i>

10:32.320 --> 10:38.140
<i>Thanks for waiting.
He's like, "Is it weird to carry around spare condoms?"</i>

10:38.240 --> 10:41.040
What the hell kind of question is that?!

10:41.880 --> 10:44.750
<i>Um, I've been wondering about this for a little while.</i>

10:45.170 --> 10:48.800
<i>He always texts you or calls you, even
over stupid things, doesn't he?</i>

10:49.690 --> 10:51.090
<i>Well, sure, we're friends.</i>

10:51.250 --> 10:52.680
Oh. That's right.

10:54.000 --> 10:56.430
You can call me or whatever whenever you want, too.

10:57.140 --> 11:00.440
Er, but I only know your home number...

11:00.780 --> 11:04.650
<i>What, really? Then I'll give you my number tomorrow.</i>

11:05.040 --> 11:09.720
<i>That's weird, you're my closest friend right now, too.</i>

11:11.040 --> 11:13.030
<i>Well, I'll see you tomorrow.</i>

11:13.350 --> 11:14.240
Thanks.

11:15.000 --> 11:15.870
<i>Kokusai-san...</i>

11:16.110 --> 11:16.490
Hm?

11:21.370 --> 11:23.130
Goodnight.

11:34.040 --> 11:36.350
Chiga? I'm coming.

11:40.390 --> 11:42.770
Hey, Chiga. Morning.

11:45.980 --> 11:46.860
Morning

11:48.230 --> 11:49.400
You know something...

11:49.940 --> 11:53.540
Uh... Good morning, president.

11:53.540 --> 11:56.120
I'm not talking about the greeting!

11:56.520 --> 11:58.830
It's, I mean... You're so embarrassing..

12:06.540 --> 12:09.800
And you've got an embarrassing tag sticking out.

12:17.430 --> 12:21.770
Er, this shirt just came back from the
cleaners. Guess I forgot to remove it.

12:22.490 --> 12:24.000
Then...

12:24.160 --> 12:26.930
Brand New

12:27.350 --> 12:29.570
I wasn't the only one?

12:39.200 --> 12:40.040
Kokusai-san.

12:42.430 --> 12:43.410
What's wrong?

12:43.700 --> 12:44.960
Uh, nothing...

12:45.540 --> 12:48.460
Someone was there just now, watching us.

12:48.920 --> 12:50.740
Chiga, let's go!

12:51.910 --> 12:55.720
It occurred to me for a second that it wouldn't
be too surprising if this airhead had a stalker,

12:56.090 --> 12:58.100
and the idea scared me.

13:06.910 --> 13:07.730
Chiga-kun!

13:09.020 --> 13:11.610
Wow, he really does look good!

13:11.940 --> 13:13.880
I'm so glad we ran into you!

13:13.960 --> 13:17.030
He's so tall, with such small features!

13:17.260 --> 13:21.290
We found out about you from the men's magazine.

13:22.520 --> 13:24.910
You're familiar with our editorial department, right?

13:26.700 --> 13:28.250
Could one of them have been the figure I saw...?

13:28.740 --> 13:30.190
No, that was a man.

13:30.650 --> 13:34.520
Today we were hoping we could do a little blurb
about you in the women's magazine, too.

13:35.090 --> 13:36.970
I'm wearing some old clothes I just threw together.

13:38.130 --> 13:39.890
It doesn't matter!

13:40.510 --> 13:44.640
The idea is we're showcasing the email addresses of cute guys...

13:45.740 --> 13:47.520
I don't have a cell phone.

13:47.780 --> 13:48.770
Liar.

13:49.390 --> 13:53.650
There's nothing to worry about, you'll be just
one picture out of about twenty guys.

13:53.790 --> 13:56.490
It really won't cause you any trouble.

13:56.780 --> 13:59.620
Yo-You can even take a picture with your friend, if you'd like.

14:01.970 --> 14:03.490
Okay, in that case.

14:08.090 --> 14:08.870
Why...?

14:09.170 --> 14:10.830
No real reason. Just because.

14:11.300 --> 14:13.170
I'd like to know why myself.

14:14.350 --> 14:17.090
I don't want to do it! It's embarrassing...

14:18.260 --> 14:22.220
There's nothing embarrassing about it.
Think of it as a commemorative picture.

14:22.390 --> 14:24.390
Er, but, I mean...

14:24.970 --> 14:27.480
It might not even get published.

14:28.810 --> 14:31.150
But you're the one they asked!

14:32.740 --> 14:34.320
Is he about to cry...?

14:42.520 --> 14:43.950
Let's take some together.

14:48.570 --> 14:49.700
Are you getting this?

14:49.960 --> 14:52.210
Um, well, yes...

14:52.780 --> 14:54.920
I feel kind of, embarrassed...

15:05.780 --> 15:06.470
Sorry!

15:07.570 --> 15:08.270
Kokusai-san!

15:14.860 --> 15:19.320
Um, could we get a few shots of you alone, too?

15:20.520 --> 15:23.200
Damn it! What the hell am I doing?

15:34.560 --> 15:36.800
Chiga! Are you all done?

15:37.420 --> 15:40.970
Kokusai-san. I thought you'd gone home.

15:41.100 --> 15:42.380
I wouldn't go home.

15:42.740 --> 15:45.520
Oh, um, sorry about before. I must've really ruined the mood, huh.

15:46.100 --> 15:48.520
No, I'm the one who should apologize for forcing you like that...

15:49.220 --> 15:54.600
Yeah, well, I was really embarrassed.
I know they didn't want me there.

15:54.830 --> 15:55.580
Oh, really?

15:56.060 --> 15:58.660
Is that a common thing, them taking your picture like that?

15:59.030 --> 16:02.740
Just when they run local features. They probably
don't have too many subjects they can use.

16:03.030 --> 16:06.120
I see... You do look pretty cool, after all.

16:06.290 --> 16:08.200
And you're adorable.

16:09.460 --> 16:11.830
Kokusai-san, your hair is so soft.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.590
It is, huh?

16:14.980 --> 16:16.420
I have this feeling that maybe...

16:17.090 --> 16:19.710
I wanted to show him off to someone.

16:21.300 --> 16:24.720
Right now, I'm the one closest to him.

16:25.180 --> 16:28.060
Right now, I'm the one talking to him the most.

16:33.440 --> 16:35.770
And probably, right now...

16:37.190 --> 16:38.020
Chiga...?

16:38.610 --> 16:44.490
I'm the one who loves him the most.

17:02.770 --> 17:04.760
Chiga, you stupid...!

17:06.460 --> 17:08.550
I'm home! Grandma?

17:09.290 --> 17:11.220
Huh? She's not home?

17:11.510 --> 17:14.600
That's odd, she left the door open.

17:20.980 --> 17:22.860
I can't get it out of my head...

17:38.290 --> 17:45.090
His lips were moist... because he licked them as he leaned in.

17:47.330 --> 17:53.720
Oh, what should I do? Something, I've got
to do something--I need to calm down!

17:58.770 --> 18:01.370
Akutsu?! I need some advice!

18:02.330 --> 18:04.530
<i>All right, just calm down.</i>

18:05.160 --> 18:06.490
O-Okay...

18:06.900 --> 18:08.360
<i>So, what happened?</i>

18:09.570 --> 18:10.700
I can't say it!

18:11.030 --> 18:13.580
I can't tell him an underclassman's
little prank made my heart throb!

18:15.540 --> 18:18.460
Hey, didn't you go get your hair cut with Chiga?

18:18.720 --> 18:19.940
I-I didn't get it cut!

18:20.330 --> 18:22.630
Oh, just hearing his name is...

18:23.680 --> 18:27.300
By the way, Chiga's practicing on his own with you, isn't he?

18:27.880 --> 18:29.470
Tell him to keep it up.

18:30.390 --> 18:33.460
If he loses his edge, it will affect the team competition.

18:33.900 --> 18:36.390
O-Okay. Sorry...

18:36.850 --> 18:38.980
<i>No, you don't need to apologize.</i>

18:40.150 --> 18:40.850
Eh?

18:42.110 --> 18:42.820
<i>What happened?</i>

18:45.070 --> 18:49.110
No-Nothing, I just heard a noise...
Might be a ghost? Heh, just kidding.

18:49.820 --> 18:50.450
<i>I'm hanging up.</i>

18:50.680 --> 18:51.700
Wha-?!

18:56.550 --> 19:00.210
Stupid Akutsu. He's nice when he's texting!

19:04.770 --> 19:07.160
The noise came from over here...

19:09.370 --> 19:13.260
That reminds me, I unlocked the front door and came in...

19:16.830 --> 19:17.980
It's just my cell...

19:20.070 --> 19:20.940
<i>Kokusai-san?</i>

19:23.020 --> 19:24.400
Chiga!

19:25.510 --> 19:27.070
<i>What? What's wrong?</i>

19:27.160 --> 19:28.500
No, it's nothing.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.720
Anyway, what's up?

19:29.770 --> 19:31.440
<i>Hey, Kokusai-san..</i>

19:35.120 --> 19:36.330
About today...

19:45.550 --> 19:47.460
It's locked.

19:47.920 --> 19:52.550
Ugh, I'm not even sure what exactly my
heart's pounding about anymore!

19:53.140 --> 19:54.600
Are you angry?

19:56.970 --> 19:58.890
I'm not angry.

19:59.510 --> 20:05.360
I was worried that maybe that had been your first kiss.<i></i>

20:06.020 --> 20:09.290
I'd feel terrible if you'd been saving it.

20:09.990 --> 20:11.740
Hey, don't patronize me.

20:12.280 --> 20:15.910
<i>Then, is it okay if I come pick you up Monday morning?</i>

20:16.110 --> 20:18.990
Ye-Yeah, thanks.

20:20.370 --> 20:25.160
<i>Please don't act awkward or self-conscious.
You'll make me embarrassed, too.</i>

20:25.240 --> 20:26.460
I won't!

20:27.000 --> 20:28.190
<i>Bye then, I'll see you tomorrow.</i>

20:28.230 --> 20:31.050
Oh, wait! Wait, wait!

20:31.240 --> 20:33.290
<i>What is it?</i>

20:33.760 --> 20:37.760
I'm locking up the doors and windows.
Just stay on the phone with me.

20:39.260 --> 20:41.020
Don't laugh in my ear!

20:41.330 --> 20:42.290
<i>Do excuse me.</i>

20:43.370 --> 20:44.850
The window's locked, too.

20:45.310 --> 20:46.860
Was it my imagination...?

20:51.930 --> 20:53.680
Okay, I'm done now.

20:53.950 --> 20:57.780
<i>You are? Okay, take care.</i>

21:00.370 --> 21:02.080
He's so curt!

21:07.560 --> 21:09.090
I'm kinda tired...

21:35.060 --> 21:37.030
Kokusai-san, please don't be too hard on me.

21:38.900 --> 21:39.780
Cocky little....!

21:40.490 --> 21:43.330
Oh, I see. This is a dream.

21:43.700 --> 21:46.710
This is back when Chiga had just joined the team.

21:47.960 --> 21:50.090
Going for that move already? So cocky!

22:03.940 --> 22:04.730
Kokusai-san.

22:06.940 --> 22:12.520
I used to think very little of you. I thought
you weren't anything special.

22:14.290 --> 22:17.110
But I was wrong.

22:17.780 --> 22:22.410
You really are someone who's been able to keep
up with high school practice for a year.

22:22.990 --> 22:24.830
Please spar with me again tomorrow.

22:25.540 --> 22:31.040
Chiga says some nasty things sometimes, but he
knows just what to say at the critical moment.

22:33.070 --> 22:36.130
Huh? Wha-What's up with this dream...?

22:59.900 --> 23:02.950
Dreams are... Dreams are supposed to be...

23:04.450 --> 23:05.660
Unconscious desires...?

23:15.180 --> 23:18.430
Oh my God, his tongue's in my mouth...

23:21.680 --> 23:22.390
Chiga...!

24:07.420 --> 24:11.140
Chiga, whe-where are you touching me?!

24:12.200 --> 24:15.020
Seriously, where are you touching...!

25:11.540 --> 25:12.720
Chi-Chiga...!

25:15.810 --> 25:18.880
Kokusai, you're getting hard.

25:19.630 --> 25:21.880
Huh? He didn't call me "Kokusai-san?"

25:28.620 --> 25:30.160
Your body's so sensitive.

25:31.810 --> 25:33.240
You want it bad, you little slut.

25:34.720 --> 25:36.450
This guy isn't Chiga!

25:37.190 --> 25:43.740
Chiga says nasty things, but he never
shows contempt for other people.

25:44.900 --> 25:45.910
I'm scared!

25:46.770 --> 25:47.590
...sai-san!

25:47.620 --> 25:48.430
Kokusai-san!

25:49.870 --> 25:51.870
It's the real Chiga's voice...

25:55.210 --> 25:56.980
Kokusai-san!

25:58.940 --> 25:59.840
Kokusai-san!

26:00.810 --> 26:02.420
Chi-Chiga...?

26:07.200 --> 26:08.050
Kokusai-san.

26:09.260 --> 26:10.140
Chiga!

26:10.970 --> 26:15.060
I thought Chiga was the one touching me...

26:17.730 --> 26:19.360
Damn it...

26:20.690 --> 26:21.690
Damn it...

26:23.510 --> 26:25.950
Who was it? I won't forgive them!

26:27.240 --> 26:29.160
Who the hell did this to him?!

26:30.570 --> 26:32.970
Chi-Chiga, I can't breathe...

26:33.460 --> 26:35.500
But you're trembling in my arms...!

26:41.040 --> 26:42.090
Chiga...?

26:43.510 --> 26:48.720
Kokusai-san, I want you to always have
that goofy smile on your face.

26:51.050 --> 26:53.970
Peaceful, carefree, as if you have nothing to fear...

